{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Staged \u2013 A Theatrical Co-op Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the spotlight! Staged is a chaotic 3D co-op party game for up to four players. As little goblins, you build stage sets that recreate fairy tales and bring classic European stories to life. Work together under time pressure, complete creative mini-games, and make sure every performance ends in applause.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTO THE SPOTLIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with 2\u20134 players and jump on stage. Each challenge tests your communication, coordination, and quick thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/94659230a9c4a452e302bf23eff8078b.poster.avif?t=1758144280\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/94659230a9c4a452e302bf23eff8078b.webm?t=1758144280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/94659230a9c4a452e302bf23eff8078b.mp4?t=1758144280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD, CREATE, RECREATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From painting backdrops to hauling giant props \u2013 every player contributes to the perfect set. The better you build, the smoother the performance runs in the background.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/e0c17b07b4542dc2136fa1824c1015c4.poster.avif?t=1758144280\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/e0c17b07b4542dc2136fa1824c1015c4.webm?t=1758144280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/e0c17b07b4542dc2136fa1824c1015c4.mp4?t=1758144280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHAOTIC MINI-GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle fast-paced challenges that demand teamwork and timing. Expect hilarious failures as well as triumphant successes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/90151d5d724f8de142cc30a1ac5dff3d.poster.avif?t=1758144280\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/90151d5d724f8de142cc30a1ac5dff3d.webm?t=1758144280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/90151d5d724f8de142cc30a1ac5dff3d.mp4?t=1758144280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLORFUL WORLDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play across vibrant, hand-crafted stages full of charming details \u2013 from enchanted forests to fairy-tale castles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLASSIC STORIES, REIMAGINED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience iconic stories and characters from across Europe, rebuilt with a humorous goblin twist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TOGETHER, ANYWHERE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether side by side on the couch or connected online \u2013 Staged supports both local and online co-op with full gamepad support.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FUN FOR EVERYONE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, fun to master \u2013 Staged is designed to bring laughter to families, friends, and players of all ages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LET THE CHAOS BEGIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for unpredictable fun, frantic teamwork, and goblin-sized laughs \u2013 the stage is set for chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/bbcf593088331a107c39a2fc4180a105.poster.avif?t=1758144280\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/bbcf593088331a107c39a2fc4180a105.webm?t=1758144280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/bbcf593088331a107c39a2fc4180a105.mp4?t=1758144280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534100?t=1758144280","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/88097945afb73d3572fd225e7931d0d618912a7f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758144280","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/59ad74ec5dce4a2cf7755efb691cbd5c88d910c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758144280","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/59ad74ec5dce4a2cf7755efb691cbd5c88d910c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758144280","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Gamescom 2025 Booth</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hall 10.1 \u2013 Booth A024 | Staged at Gamescom 2025!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re thrilled to announce that <strong>Staged</strong> will be playable live at <strong>Gamescom 2025</strong>!<br>Join us from <strong>August 20\u201324</strong> at our booth in <strong>Hall 10.1 \u2013 A024</strong> and experience the game firsthand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s what\u2019s waiting for you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hands-on Demo</strong> \u2013 Play Staged before anyone else</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the Devs</strong> \u2013 Chat with us and share your feedback</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive Staged Stickers</strong> \u2013 Take home a free souvenir</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019ve been following Staged for a while or are just curious, we can\u2019t wait to meet you in person!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc5 <strong>Gamescom 2025</strong><br>\ud83d\udccd <strong>Hall 10.1 \u2013 Booth A024</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you in Cologne!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Staged \u2013 A Theatrical Co-op Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the spotlight! Staged is a chaotic 3D co-op party game for up to four players. As little goblins, you build stage sets that recreate fairy tales and bring classic European stories to life. Work together under time pressure, complete creative mini-games, and make sure every performance ends in applause.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTO THE SPOTLIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with 2\u20134 players and jump on stage. Each challenge tests your communication, coordination, and quick thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/94659230a9c4a452e302bf23eff8078b.poster.avif?t=1758144280\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/94659230a9c4a452e302bf23eff8078b.webm?t=1758144280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/94659230a9c4a452e302bf23eff8078b.mp4?t=1758144280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD, CREATE, RECREATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From painting backdrops to hauling giant props \u2013 every player contributes to the perfect set. The better you build, the smoother the performance runs in the background.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/e0c17b07b4542dc2136fa1824c1015c4.poster.avif?t=1758144280\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/e0c17b07b4542dc2136fa1824c1015c4.webm?t=1758144280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/e0c17b07b4542dc2136fa1824c1015c4.mp4?t=1758144280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHAOTIC MINI-GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle fast-paced challenges that demand teamwork and timing. Expect hilarious failures as well as triumphant successes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/90151d5d724f8de142cc30a1ac5dff3d.poster.avif?t=1758144280\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/90151d5d724f8de142cc30a1ac5dff3d.webm?t=1758144280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/90151d5d724f8de142cc30a1ac5dff3d.mp4?t=1758144280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLORFUL WORLDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play across vibrant, hand-crafted stages full of charming details \u2013 from enchanted forests to fairy-tale castles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLASSIC STORIES, REIMAGINED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience iconic stories and characters from across Europe, rebuilt with a humorous goblin twist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TOGETHER, ANYWHERE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether side by side on the couch or connected online \u2013 Staged supports both local and online co-op with full gamepad support.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FUN FOR EVERYONE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, fun to master \u2013 Staged is designed to bring laughter to families, friends, and players of all ages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LET THE CHAOS BEGIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for unpredictable fun, frantic teamwork, and goblin-sized laughs \u2013 the stage is set for chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/bbcf593088331a107c39a2fc4180a105.poster.avif?t=1758144280\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/bbcf593088331a107c39a2fc4180a105.webm?t=1758144280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/extras/bbcf593088331a107c39a2fc4180a105.mp4?t=1758144280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Project Sunset"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534100/153fe54a8d4e5d61366c00a2088371b65a423668/header.jpg?t=1758144280","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steam